          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Scale existing UV coordinates to the new resolution. Supported only when Blockbench itself can rescale: the new size is square, the width changes, and old/new widths are integer multiples; otherwise the call fails with E_INVALID_PARAMS before changing anything."
